// Task - SL8_GV_Korol_Mission_1 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P4025200441" "As you may have noticed, Grandville has an enormous communications array tied into all manner of satellite transmissions worldwide. But it also serves another purpose: boosting the reach of the Fortunatas and Tarantula Queens! With the aid of the web, our senses reach further than ever before! Because of this, we must ensure that the main communications relay centers are functioning properly. <A HREF={ACCEPT}>Patrol the juncture stations of the communications web to ensure they are working properly.</A>"
// AcceptString :
"P3903940566" "Patrol the web"
// SendOffString :
"P3541153022" "If anyone gets in your way, you have my authority to dispose of them!"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P1470410204" "Report back to me once you have patrolled the web."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P3392371067" "You have completed your patrol of the web"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P3944196494" "Everything is in order? Good. I'd hate to see anything wrong happening with my lovely web."
// RandomFameString :
"P856364347" ""

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - SL8_GV_Korol_Mission_2 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P1572635865" "The Spiderlings which scuttle about Grandville are useful little creations. They maintain the majesty of our glorious city and dispose of anything undesirable. I have subverted a number of them to attend me personally and tap into parts of the web to find hidden secrets. Unfortunately, some Arachnos technicians have noticed the erratic behavior of my subverted counterparts and have started eliminating them. I will give you a tracker to show where my lovely Spiderlings are under attack.<A HREF={ACCEPT}>I need you to repel the Arachnos extermination squads before my subverted pets are destroyed!</A> <br><br>You have 60 minutes to complete this mission."
// AcceptString :
"P544294402" "Assist subverted Spiderlings"
// SendOffString :
"P1649649671" "Some of my Spiderling pets are there under attack. Rescue any there which you can!"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P4242628470" "Hurry! Rescue my Spiderlings before they are all destroyed!"

