// IntroString :
"P111647846" "I've heard voices, strange voices, reverberating to me from across my psychic network. They speak in alien voices, whispering across voids and dimensions. These voices confuse me, cause me pain. They must be silenced!<br><br>I have found a nexus point where these voices are strongest. There is one there who is known as Gr'pth'r... <A HREF={ACCEPT}>Go to this place and silence these voices!</A>"
